│ Balance       │ 100,000,000 drops (100.000000 XRP) │ 99,999,990 drops (99.999990 XRP) │            -10 drops (-0.000010 XRP) │
│ Spendable     │   99,000,000 drops (99.000000 XRP) │ 98,799,990 drops (98.799990 XRP) │       -200,010 drops (-0.200010 XRP) │
