│ Spendable     │ 98,799,990 drops (98.799990 XRP) │ 98,999,980 drops (98.999980 XRP) │          +199,990 drops (+0.199990 XRP) │
│ Owner reserve │                                — │                                — │ -200,000 drops (-0.200000 XRP) released │
